{"sources":{"odeon":{"ok":true,"films":[{"title":"Ebenezer - Eine Weihnachtsgeschichte","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Fantasy"],"dauer":116,"fsk":"10+","text":"Der knauserige Geizhals Ebenezer Scrooge (Johnny Depp) macht eine übernatürliche Begegnung, die sein Leben verändert und mit den prägenden Stationen seines Lebens konfrontiert wird. Geister der Vergangenheit (Andrea Riseborough), Gegenwart (Tramell Tillman) und Zukunft (Robert Strange) treten dabei gleichermaßen in den Fokus und zwingen ihn, sich seinen Entscheidungen und deren Folgen zu stellen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62002/ebenezer.webp?v=1794755190","trailer":"https://youtu.be/sFvLZy7dW0w","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/ebenezer-eine-weihnachtsgeschichte","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-28","time":"20:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-29","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Die Tribute von Panem - Sunrise On The Reaping","lang":"DE","genre":["Abenteuer","Action","Fantasy"],"dauer":158,"fsk":"10+","text":"24 Jahre vor Katniss Everdeens Teilnahme an den Hungerspielen gerät Haymitch Abernathy (Joseph Zada) ins Zentrum eines Ereignisses, das sein Leben nachhaltig prägen wird. In den Distrikten stehen die 50. Hungerspiele an, die als zweites Jubel-Jubiläum mit verschärften Regeln ausgetragen werden.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62005/Panem.webp?v=1794755521","trailer":"https://youtu.be/3xfVyH0iwlc","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/die-tribute-von-panem-sunrise-on-the-reaping","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-26","time":"19:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-27","time":"19:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-28","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-29","time":"16:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-12-02","time":"19:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-28","time":"20:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-29","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Wie verhext","lang":"DE","genre":[],"dauer":104,"fsk":"0+","text":"issverstanden und hat Schwierigkeiten, ihren Platz im Leben zu finden. Auch das Verhältnis zu ihrer Mutter Alice (Rashida Jones) ist von Spannungen geprägt, denn diese verhält sich überfürsorglich und stellt zahlreiche Regeln auf, deren Hintergründe Billie nicht nachvollziehen kann.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62008/019255-33_Hexed_HP_JPG_DINA3_RZ_300dpi_CMYK.webp?v=1794756459","trailer":"https://youtu.be/uc2I7z5qNcQ","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/wie-verhext","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-26","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-27","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-28","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-29","time":"15:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-12-01","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-12-02","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Meine Frau, unsere Schwiegertochter und ich","lang":"DE","genre":["Komödie"],"dauer":106,"fsk":"10+","text":"Mehr als zwei Jahrzehnte sind vergangen, seit Greg Focker (Ben Stiller) seinen Schwiegervater Jack (Robert De Niro) um die Erlaubnis bat, dessen Tochter Pam (Teri Polo) heiraten zu dürfen. Schon damals sorgte die Begegnung für zahlreiche unangenehme Situationen.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62011/focker.webp?v=1794756809","trailer":"https://youtu.be/mpLu15l1DwM","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/meine-frau-unsere-schwiegertochter-und-ich","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-26","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-27","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-28","time":"18:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-29","time":"17:15"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-12-01","time":"19:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-12-02","time":"19:30"}]},{"title":"Der Regenbogenfisch","lang":"DE","genre":["Animation"],"dauer":68,"fsk":"0+","text":"Mit seinen schimmernden Glitzerschuppen zieht der Regenbogenfisch (gesprochen von Jannik Schümann) die Blicke aller Meeresbewohner auf sich. Sein Stolz und seine Eitelkeit sorgen jedoch dafür, dass er sich immer weiter von den anderen Fischen entfernt und schließlich einsam wird.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/62028/regenbogenfisch.webp?v=1794936231","trailer":"https://youtu.be/LYRHp0SFd4s","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/der-regenbogenfisch","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-26","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-27","time":"17:30"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-28","time":"16:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-11-29","time":"15:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-12-02","time":"17:30"}]},{"title":"Dio ride","lang":"IT","genre":["Komödie"],"dauer":114,"fsk":"0+","text":"Nel cuore del '600 c'è un uomo che parla di Dio come nessuno aveva fatto prima di lui: è Frate Leopoldo da Casamacchia che racconta il Vangelo con una gioia contagiosa portando, a chi lo ascolta, sollievo e speranza. Il suo messaggio si diffonde di villaggio in villaggio, conquistando il cuore di migliaia di persone che iniziano a seguirlo ovunque.","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/p5cuENoUviYoK6IBHg2FS4oTRGD.webp?v=1795597819","trailer":"https://youtu.be/GyQz-5xlIsc","url":"https://www.odeonkino.com/de/programm/dio-ride","shows":[{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-12-01","time":"18:00"},{"ort":"Bruneck","date":"2026-12-01","time":"20:30"}]}],"soon":[{"title":"Avengers 5: Doomsday","lang":"DE","release":"","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-center_82_line/avengers.webp?v=1786294375","trailer":"https://youtu.be/GKVUZvWk6Aw?si=LB8vkd1C2g-Gl-Qz"},{"title":"Dune 3","lang":"DE","release":"","poster":"https://www.odeonkino.com/assets/images/Poster/_1080x1528_crop_center-cent